{"page":17,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:106","surah":2,"ayah":106,"ar_uthmani":"۞ مَا نَنسَخْ مِنْ ءَايَةٍ أَوْ نُنسِهَا نَأْتِ بِخَيْرٍ مِّنْهَآ أَوْ مِثْلِهَآ ۗ أَلَمْ تَعْلَمْ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Any revelation We cause to be superseded or forgotten, We replace with something better or similar. Do you [Prophet] not know that God has power over everything?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ مَا","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَنسَخْ","en_gloss":"We abrogate","transliteration":"nansakh","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"(of)","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَةٍ","en_gloss":"a sign","transliteration":"āyatin","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نُنسِهَا","en_gloss":"[We] cause it to be forgotten","transliteration":"nunsihā","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَأْتِ","en_gloss":"We bring","transliteration":"nati","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِخَيْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"better","transliteration":"bikhayrin","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنْهَآ","en_gloss":"than it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِثْلِهَآ ۗ","en_gloss":"similar (to) it","transliteration":"mith'lihā","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَعْلَمْ","en_gloss":"you know","transliteration":"taʿlam","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"2:106"},{"pos